# PRTab EOS backend — bicubic-table PR (tabulated T(rho,e) forward solve
# with PR fallback outside the table domain / on guard rejection).
#
# This mirrors PR/Make.package.  The fluid and the contract surface are
# EOS/PR/pr_base.H and EOS/PR/pr_contract.H, included by path (do NOT
# add ../PR to the include path — both backends name their header EOS.H
# and an earlier -I would silently shadow this one); PRTab carries
# forwarders for hem_pr_state.H and hem_saturation_amrex.H.  The
# generated table sources (prtab_table_data.cpp / prtab_table_params.H)
# are git-ignored and built by `make tables` — see tools/.

CEXE_headers += EOS.H
CEXE_headers += prtab_bicubic.H
CEXE_headers += hem_pr_state.H
CEXE_headers += hem_saturation_amrex.H

# Table data (bicubic PR EOS) compiled ONCE here; prtab_bicubic.H only
# declares the arrays extern, so the widely-included header stays small.
CEXE_sources += prtab_table_data.cpp
